# BASIC test run (text shell, NODESK): "basic -t /BT.BAS" runs tests/basic.bas as a script.
# It runs /programs/TESTS.BAS (PASS / FAIL per group), then the error, LIST, INPUT, CONT,
# SAVE / LOAD cases, then the benchmarks. The console is mirrored into the log
# (build/basic-t.out); the part after the command is compared with tests/basic.txt.
# About 110 s of emulated time.
1500 {esc}
+1500 basic -t /BT.BAS\n
